<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Sherwood.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Sherwood.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwood International Plc, a producer of software for insurance companies, was rated &quot;trading buy&quot; at Goldman Sachs as the investment bank started coverage of the stock.</p>
<p>The shares were up 24p at 229 by 1231 GMT.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
